{"findings":[{"rule_id":"WPS-004","evidence":[{"kind":"dimension","ref":"D12","page":1,"quote":"⌀ 16 H7 (+0.018/0)"},{"kind":"title_block","ref":"surface_treatment","page":1,"quote":"HARD ANODIZING"}],"comment":"The ⌀16 H7 hole (D12) carries a tight ISO fit but the drawing specifies hard anodizing with no allowance for coating thickness; the anodize layer will shrink the bore and break the fit. The designer should either add a pre-coating oversize to D12 or add a note requiring the hole to be reamed/machined after anodizing."
  ,
  "recommended_correction":"Add a note such as 'Ream ⌀16 H7 hole after hard anodizing' or specify the pre-anodize diameter to allow for coating buildup."}]}
